==Esperanto==
===Etymology===
The root of {{term|ĉefo||chief|lang=eo}}; constructed from {{etyl|en}} {{term|chief|lang=en}}, {{etyl|fr}} {{term|chef|lang=fr}}, among others; ultimately from {{etyl|la}} {{term|caput||head|lang=la}} and {{proto|Indo-European|kauput-|head, bowl}}.

